ど、Vtuber活動に使わせていただきたいです。\n\nキャラクター単体での使用や、切り抜いての使用、サイズ変更(100％比率での拡大縮小)や角度を変更したり、素材(フレームやスタンプ)や文字を重ねることがあります。\nまた、ネットプリントや視聴者様への企画参加等の際のお礼メッセージなどの特典に使用することがあります。(アクキーなど、販売物としての商用利用は予定していません)\n使用内容としてNGな内容が含まれていましたら、お断りください。\n\nイラスト使用時には、基本的に画像内もしくは概要欄等でイラストレーター様の紹介をします。\n(ネットプリントの場合は画像内に名前を表記)\n\n■人物について\n　縁側でのんびりお茶をするのが好きな、穏やかでちょっとお茶目な性格。\nチャームポイントは、タレ目と黄色いお花の髪飾りです。\n\n資料は下記URLにてご確認いただけます。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CUVHicrGCmA5NN-nga-kUbt-X-gxqpX8?usp=sharing\n\nどうぞよろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CUVHicrGCmA5NN-nga-kUbt-X-gxqpX8?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nasukeke_l_nuwa/works/124", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9d302d13/uploads/origins/ef4cc4e4-990c-42de-b398-30859df36ba4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5398f0c1b6925044b3bb7675bca78012", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9d302d13/uploads/origins/ef4cc4e4-990c-42de-b398-30859df36ba4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5398f0c1b6925044b3bb7675bca78012, https://si.imgix.net/9d302d13/uploads/origins/ef4cc4e4-990c-42de-b398-30859df36ba4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1c898f6640f7a12d9377d4bfbe35fea5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9d302d13/uploads/origins/ef4cc4e4-990c-42de-b398-30859df36ba4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e0b9b0778030dd7d68b23c22b438e6b7 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! I'd love to request an original OC inspired by the general aesthetic direction shown in the references — especially the black and white hair contrast, angelic elements, and a swimsuit / thong-strap flip-flops vibe. I really like the contrast-heavy palette and the feeling of casual, relaxed divinity. I don't want a copy of the referenced character. The images are just for mood and inspiration, so please feel free to change the hair pattern and structure, outfit details, silhouette, wings, halo, and overall presence so the design is fully original. I'd love for you to reinterpret the idea freely and add your own creative touches .The angelic theme is flexible, so you're welcome to explore ideas. One thing I was thinking is that her right eye black and left eye white, her right fingers and toenails black to match the black eye and her left white fingers and toenails. Cod play around with anything as much as you want.  Thanks for considering my request\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/s6270w.png\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/rh77ap.png\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/s6270w.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nasukeke_l_nuwa/works/123", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/be079243/uploads/origins/2d547932-ecc0-440c-93ae-76e3e74be77a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=060a0cc686fb2408e6c1643172b32dc2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/be079243/uploads/origins/2d547932-ecc0-440c-93ae-76e3e74be77a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=060a0cc686fb2408e6c1643172b32dc2, https://si.imgix.net/be079243/uploads/origins/2d547932-ecc0-440c-93ae-76e3e74be77a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a33ab38433805725471460dc06cb1a05 2x, https://si.imgix.net/be079243/uploads/origins/2d547932-ecc0-440c-93ae-76e3e74be77a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=150ff0c8e896ca1dd5a689345a7a1137 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@nasukeke_l_nuwa/works/122",